inverse: SetBodyClass { body: 585, from: PlanetClassRule { class: "pc_ocean", change: Any, models: 3 }, to: PlanetClassRule { class: "pc_barren", change: Uncolonised, models: 3 }, look: Some(PlanetLook { entity: Some(2), entity_name: None }) }

--- gamestate
